h1 GameTips Community

p Welcome to GameTips Community, a platform designed for gamers to browse and explore gaming tips shared by other members of the community.

h2 About the Website

p The purpose of the website is to create a simple community platform where players can discover useful advice, gameplay strategies, and tips for different games in one organised place.

p Users are able to browse community members, view individual user profiles, and explore gaming tips connected to each specific user.

h2 Features

ul
  li Browse gaming tips from different users
  li View user profile pages
  li Explore tips connected to different games
  li Read detailed gaming advice and strategies

h2 Popular Games Included

ul
  li EA Sports FC 26
  li Valorant
  li Minecraft
  li Call of Duty
  li Fortnite

h2 About the Project

p This project was developed as part of a Software Engineering module and focuses on creating a community-based gaming web application.